# Trade and boarding

Before changing Trade behavior, read `docs/handoffs/trade.md`.

Trading writes TS17 and TS19 with different fields. Economy reads those same `TRADE` rows and prices them through `App/trade/tradePriceFactory.js`. For TS20 capacity, boarding, or unloading changes, also read `docs/handoffs/boarding-ts20.md`.
